      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“千重子无论长得怎么漂亮，我也从不曾想过要拿她的婚姻去做买卖。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No matter how beautiful Chieko became, I never once thought of using her marriage as a business deal.",
          "g": "predicate"
