    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01282",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "对吧，繁？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Isn't that right, Shige?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01282",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "要是那样就太对不起神灵啦。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If I did that, I would be far too ashamed before the gods.",
